One thing worth knowing about "brain rot": in a 2025 meta-analysis, the hard-to-stop pull and leaning on the feed to manage your mood were linked with weaker focus more than time spent. Correlations, not proof.

So watch your state, not the clock. When the wired feeling hits mid-scroll: phone face down, in for 4, out for 6, six rounds.

